{"sourceUrl":"https://civil.hit.edu.cn/2026/0702/c8439a395650/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:52.439551+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://civil.hit.edu.cn/2026/0702/c8439a395650/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>为促进高校优秀大学生之间的学术交流，加强学生对哈尔滨工业大学土木工程学院的了解，我院将于</span><span><span>2026</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span><span>月线下举办</span><span>“暑期学术交流营”</span><span>活动。</span></span></p><p><span><strong>一、申请资格</strong></span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>．拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，身心健康、诚实守信，学风端正；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>．学术交流营主要招募</span></span><span><span>2027</span><span>年届高水平研究型大学优秀本科生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>．</span><span>本科所学专业应为土木工程、力学、土木工程材料、工程管理等相关专业。</span><span>学习成绩优秀，学生本科前</span></span><span><span>3</span><span>年（或前</span></span><span><span>5</span><span>学期）的综合成绩在本专业排名靠前，达到所在高校推荐免试生要求，来自一流高校或学科专业排名前</span></span><span><span>10%</span><span>的推免生优先考虑。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span><span>．外语水平优良。</span></span></p><p><span><strong>二、申请流程</strong></span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>．申请形式：</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>1</span><span>）填写以下报名表单。</span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://civil.hit.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/ec/5e/2f49798d483fa97520cb3534ed93/71c2cd1b-0ee2-4496-8d20-0cd6faae2c9b.png\"/></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>2</span><span>）报名表单：</span></span><span>https://v.wjx.cn/vm/PpzOxGs.aspx#      </span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>3</span><span>）报名截止时间：</span></span><span><span>2026</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>17</span><span>：</span></span><span><span>00</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>．申请材料：</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>1</span><span>）个人简历；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>2</span><span>）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章成绩排名证明原件扫描件，原件备查；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>3</span><span>）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的成绩单原件的扫描件，原件备查；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>4</span><span>）体现英语水平证明材料（国家英语四六级，</span></span><span><span>TOEFL</span><span>成绩，</span></span><span><span>GRE</span><span>成绩等）；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>5</span><span>）其他证明材料，包括：①已发表论文。其中代表性论文</span></span><span><span>1</span><span>篇，应提供全文，其他已发表论文提供期刊目录、论文首页；②本科期间各类获奖证书。③其他突出表现的证明材料。</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://civil.hit.edu.cn/2026/0702/c8439a395650/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>请申请人将以上材料电子版（或扫描）后整合为一个</span><span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，文件命名为“</span></span><span><span>2026</span><span>年土木工程学院学术交流营</span></span><span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span>+</span><span>本科院校名称”，邮件主题为“</span></span><span><span>2026</span><span>年土木工程学院学术交流营</span></span><span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span>+</span><span>本科院校名称”，发送至邮箱 </span></span><a href=\"mailto:gdtmzs@163.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>gdtmzs@163.com</span></a><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>．确定名单：</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://civil.hit.edu.cn/2026/0702/c8439a395650/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>学院根据申请者的网上报名信息及提交的材料，确定入营者名单。入营者名单将于</span><span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>17</span><span>日前通过邮件通知。届时未入选者，不另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span>入选者请携带申请材料以便进行资格复审：个人有效身份证件</span><span><span>,</span><span>申请材料的</span></span><span><span>2-4</span><span>（原件），以上材料原件在入营时审核。</span></span></p><p><span><strong>三、活动安排</strong></span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>．报名时间：</span></span><span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>-7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span><span>日网上报名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>．活动时间：</span></span><span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>27-29</span><span>日。开展线下活动，如有特殊情况将另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>活动内容：</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>1</span><span>）开营式，介绍学校与学院基本情况</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>2</span><span>）学科前沿报告</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>3</span><span>）学科交流</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>4</span><span>）参观院史馆和实验室</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><strong>四、其他说明</strong></span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>．学院将为所有营员统一提供学术交流营期间在哈尔滨的住宿、参观和人身保险等费用；</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://civil.hit.edu.cn/2026/0702/c8439a395650/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span>2</span><span>．营员报到后要求全程参加学术交流营的活动。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>．具体日程可能根据实际情况进行调整；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span><span>．具体政策以学校当年的文件为准。</span></span></p><p><span><strong>五、联系方式</strong></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>联 系 人：陈老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：</span><span>0451-86282073</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：</span><span>gdtmzs @163.com</span></p><p><span><span>2026</span><span>年土木工程学院暑期学术交流营</span></span><span><span>QQ</span><span>群号：</span></span><span>1046130852</span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://civil.hit.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/ec/5e/2f49798d483fa97520cb3534ed93/606e8989-4f8a-47d1-84da-43e2b57352c5.png\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>土木工程学院</span></p><p><span><span>2026</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"7b5e75c92a9430198a3259fc241ee7384bb04a1255234f35c7f3c8dc01af43dc","textLength":1110,"sourceSha256":"84bf47b1d98726761f9e38e788a32c8e5dcd2ab87acbba97620cbe2745a1846f","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c1836832cf268d5ddf05","title":"2026年哈尔滨工业大学土木工程学院2026年学术交流营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:52.439551+00:00"}
